5pt'><td colspan=5 height=15 valign=top class=x12 style='height:11.25pt; vertical-align:top; text-align:left;'> - BTN de 03/1989 a 03/1990</td><td colspan=4 valign=top class=x12 style='vertical-align:top; white-space:normal; word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:break-word;'>     C) Subtotal = (A x B):</td><td colspan=4 valign=top class=x11 style='vertical-align:top; white-space:normal; word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:break-word;'>15,42</td></tr><tr height=15 style='height:11.25pt'><td colspan=5 height=15 valign=top class=x12 style='height:11.25pt; vertical-align:top; text-align:left;'> - IPC (IBGE) de 03/1990 a 02/1991</td><td colspan=4 valign=top class=x12 style='vertical-align:top; white-space:normal; word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:break-word;'>     D) Taxa SELIC:</td><td colspan=4 valign=top class=x11 style='vertical-align:top; white-space:normal; word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:break-word;'>406,11%</td></tr><tr height=15 style='height:11.25pt'><td colspan=5 height=15 valign=top class=x12 style='height:11.25pt; vertical-align:top; text-align:left;'> - INPC de 03/1991 a 11/1991</td><td colspan=4 valign=top class=x12 style='vertical-align:top; white-space:normal; word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:break-word;'>     E) Juros SELIC = C x (D/100): </td><td colspan=4 valign=top class=x11 style='vertical-align:top; white-space:normal; word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:break-word;'>62,62</td></tr><tr height=15 style='height:11.25pt'><td colspan=5 height=15 valign=top class=x12 style='height:11.25pt; vertical-align:top; text-align:left;'> - IPCA (série especial) em 12/1991</td><td colspan=4 valign=top class=x12 style='vertical-align:top; white-space:normal; word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:break-word;'>     E) TOTAL DEVIDO em REAL (R$) = (C + E): </td><td colspan=4 valign=top class=x11 style='ver